    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but how do i even start? it feels impossible to change things here. there's no real way out. even if i try to be myself, they'll just find a way to pull me back into the mold. it feels like the walls are just getting closer every day. when you talk about \"letting go,\" it sounds so simple, but it feels like there's no way to actually achieve that kind of freedom while I'm still stuck in this body and this life.",
