      "content": "accepting that i'm trapped? that just sounds like giving up. so what am i supposed to do? just sit here and let them crush me until there's nothing left of who i actually am? it feels like the only way to actually stop the pressure, the only way to finally have some peace and not be controlled anymore, is to just... stop everything. to just exit. is that really the only way to be truly free from all this?",
